        "subject": "LU-11728 tests: skip connectathon for old clients in nfsv3",
        "message": "LU-11728 tests: skip connectathon for old clients in nfsv3\n\nInterop sessions run the test scripts of the older client branch,\nwhich still run connectathon under NFSv3. Its locking tests fail\nwith ENOLCK (LU-18649), so every such session fails\nparallel-scale-nfsv3 test_connectathon. Master already skips the\ntest.\n\nSkip it for clients older than the LU-18649 skip, through the\nserver-side except file rather than changing the old branches.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=parallel-scale-nfsv3\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I16100176d80db45403c7924a314db5bd53bf4491\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
